        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH23PD8440, Square Urban Privacy Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urban Flush Pull Privacy Set comes packaged with 2 square flush pulls and a privacy mortise box. A privacy pocket door set can be locked from the interior for privacy on bathrooms and bedrooms. It also has an emergency release on the exterior. The Square Urban Privacy Door Passage Set is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-passage-set-inox-fh23pd8010\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-keyed-entry-set-inox-fh23pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Urban Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\", 2-3/4\", or 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH23PD8440-specifications.pdf?v=1704262379\"><b>INOX FH23PD8440 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
